{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-13","kind":"proposition","title":"作两条线段的比例中项","englishTitle":"To two given straight lines to find a mean proportional.","book":6,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","contentId":"euclid-6-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f346ffb81578a377fa35a160bc2ac37071b0c246ae287fff005d44dc73612e91","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-13.statement","euclid-6-13.construction.1","euclid-6-13.construction.2","euclid-6-13.proof.1","euclid-6-13.proof.2","euclid-6-13.conclusion","euclid-6-13.historical.1","euclid-6-13.historical.2","euclid-6-13.historical.3","euclid-6-13.historical.4","euclid-6-13.historical.5","euclid-6-13.historical.6","euclid-6-13.historical.7","euclid-6-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43259d5bca07b295f40a9a5a9821cee70883067db2932386a0d11fd46f1681d1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To two given straight lines to find a mean proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"向两条直线 找到比例中项"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线求别作一线为连比例之中率"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定两条线段，作一条作为这两条线段比例中项的线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59b11e08c34ec777d2190b2d2eb9a64d738a581ca312dc5d1e586e82df13360d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, BC be the two given straight lines; thus it is required to find a mean proportional to AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC是两条直线,因此需要找到一条比例中项至AB,BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66b6d3877a26913d4e66fa81eca71ef6b54fed4a5ce8b166fa98b29817c2f3d4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be placed in a straight line, and let the semicircle ADC be described on AC; let BD be drawn from the point B at right angles to the straight line AC, and let AD, DC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们直线排列,AC分描述ADC半圆圈;直角分将BD分从B分划至AC分直线,AD分DC分连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26d6d8518cb24475d8f79790d0660e74e0f2c9260d32daccb47fea9d7cd58855","citations":["euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since the angle ADC is an angle in a semicircle, it is right. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ADC角是半圆形的一个角度,所以是正确的。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3601a233aa3a04db6fbff54e1f2a1696ea3ba2ec758d246bb1f6c07a2e3a66d4","citations":["euclid-6-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, in the right-angled triangle ADC, DB has been drawn from the right angle perpendicular to the base, therefore DB is a mean proportional between the segments of the base, AB, BC. [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"而在直角三角形 ADC中,从直角的直线到底边的直线抽取了DB,因此,底边、AB、BC的中间部分是直角三角形。 [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"830f5387ab9498b6b8c1f1e82f448704ec5f07b25d2e3a80abc5c67c9e00e4c4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore to the two given straight lines AB, BC a mean proportional DB has been found. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的两条直线AB、BC和比例中项、DB上找到了Q、E、F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5622ddecaeb824c98adde0c0f4b87dfb4a194a1c5b0e1bc99fab3009d19e7a46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线求别作一线为连比例之中率"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定两条线段，作一条作为这两条线段比例中项的线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f047f3a7a57ffa777f11360839f8ada5234b6b5263ed49379385a1439ed27692","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙乙丙两直线求别作一线为中率者谓甲乙与他线之比例若他线与乙丙也先以两线作一直线为甲丙次以甲丙两平分于戊次以戊为心甲丙为界作甲丁丙半圜末从乙至圜界作乙丁垂线即乙丁为甲乙乙丙之中率"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：甲乙乙丙，在寻找两条直线时，先画出一条作为中项的直线。这里指的是 甲乙 与其他直线的比例。如果另一条直线是 乙丙，先画两条直线作为直线 甲丙，然后在 戊 处将 甲丙 分开，再以 戊 为中心，以 甲丙 为边界画出 甲丁丙。在半圆末端，从 乙 画一条垂直于圆周的直线，即 乙丁 是 甲乙乙丙 的中项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98ddfb9a87de356286e1947af14b923e475ff8aafa6ec547c149d7fe986a8563","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试从丁作丁甲丁丙两线即甲丁丙为直角〈三卷〉〈卅一〉而直角所下乙丁垂线两分对边线甲丙其甲乙与乙丁若乙丁与乙丙也〈本篇八之系〉则乙丁为甲乙乙丙之中率"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试从丁作丁甲丁丙两线即甲丁丙为直角〈三卷〉〈卅一〉而直角所下乙丁垂线两分对边线甲丙其甲乙与乙丁若乙丁与乙丙也〈本篇八之系〉则乙丁为甲乙乙丙之中率"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9096edea5a3a9c4ff765d1bf3c2e0ca966220b1f2336689a25beab19facc101d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"注曰：依此题可推凡半圜内之垂线皆为分径线之中率线如甲乙丙半圜其乙丁为甲丁丁丙之中率己戊为甲戊戊丙之中率辛庚为甲庚庚丙之中率也何者半圜之内从垂线作角皆为直角〈三卷卅一〉故依前论推显各为中率也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"注曰：依此题可推凡半圆内之垂线皆为分径线之中率线如甲乙丙半圆其乙丁为甲丁丁丙之中率己戊为甲戊戊丙之中率辛庚为甲庚庚丙之中率也何者半圆之内从垂线作角皆为直角〈三卷卅一〉故依前论推显各为中率也"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad60321450fb182b616e8cc2e8359a9f7ed48824e2074ea30f65e7f57055300b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"増题：一直线有他直线大于元线二倍以上求分他线为两分而以元线为中率"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"补充命题：给定一条线段，以及另一条长度大于它两倍的线段。把较长的线段分成两部分，使给定线段成为这两部分的比例中项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67b8b559817b10282f9d472bfb1cb72b8f623b11dd505f7ec895533ab7a6bd12","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙线大于甲丙二倍以上求两分甲乙而以甲丙为中率先以甲乙甲丙聨为丙甲乙直角而两平分甲乙于下次以丁为心甲乙为界作甲戊乙半圜次从丙作丙戊线与甲乙平行而遇半圜界于戊末从戊作戊己垂线而分甲乙于己即戊己为甲己己乙两分之中率"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作图方法如下：甲乙线大于甲丙二倍以上求两分甲乙而以甲丙为中率先以甲乙甲丙连接为丙甲乙直角而平分甲乙于下次以丁为心甲乙为界作甲戊乙半圆次从丙作丙戊线与甲乙平行而遇半圆周于戊末从戊作戊己垂线而分甲乙于己即戊己为甲己己乙两分之中率"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.historical.7","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c56c3d2a61510d13cf191cedf5e375dfedcb7f0c51a1a32afa6cbbeff286223","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作戊甲戊乙两线依本题论即戊己为甲己己乙之中率而甲丙戊己为平行方形即丙甲与戊己等〈一卷卅四〉则丙甲亦甲己己乙之中率也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试作戊甲戊乙两线依本题论即戊己为甲己己乙之中率而甲丙戊己为平行四边形即丙甲与戊己等〈一卷卅四〉则丙甲亦甲己己乙之中率也"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-13.source","contentId":"euclid-6-13","revisionId":"euclid-6-13@raw-f346ffb81578a377","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ff0fb7e631889bfbec354398cff8ae1b8d80864cc8c69ada3925adc64cc1f93","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-13:euclid-3-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-13.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"III. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-13:euclid-6-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-13.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng